{"PASSING_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=5,13",{"Nine days and I still jump at my own shadow","Anybody tell you the Army's gone? Because they're gone","I stopped waiting for the news, nobody's talking","Week and a half of this, how's that for you","Radio's been dead since Monday, so you're the news","Still alive, huh? Good, that's two of us","I used to be somebody on Friday, now I just walk","Don't ask me what day it is, I've got a rock for every one","I miss the hum of the fridge, isn't that stupid?","Anybody still handing out anything? Anywhere? Rumors count","Haven't had a hot bath since the ninth, don't get close","I keep setting two cups out, then I put one back","I'd kill for a pizza, honest to God, a gas station pizza","There's a rumor about a camp near the river, any truth to it?"}},
